      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Jason Control Panel \u2014 Operations & Configuration\nOne operator view for **scheduled work, important configuration, production contracts, and migration/upgrade state**. Migration stages come from Release Manager records; configuration values come from the live runtime and governed policy files. Grafana remains a control surface rather than an authority source. Changes must flow through Jason's governed controls.\n\n**Governed controls:** [Component Control](/d/jason-component-control) \u00b7 [Playbook Control](/d/jason-playbook-control-center) \u00b7 [Credential Management](/d/jason-credential-management) \u00b7 [Production Health](/d/jason-production-health) \u00b7 [Support & TODO](/d/jason-support-todo)",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Jason Control Panel",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "jason-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Authoritative host systemd timers whose unit names begin with jason-. Next/last run and health are shown in the panels below.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "jason_scheduled_task_info",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Jason Scheduled Work",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "description": "Purpose",
              "last_result": "Last Result",
              "service": "Service",
              "unit": "Timer"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
